//----------------------------------------------------------
// Timing
// How long before the event opens, when it is announced, how long it lasts and when it closes.
//   Warning: Minutes before the start in which players can already go in. The server announces it every minute.
//   Waiting Time: Minutes players wait inside after the entrance closes, before the event begins.
//   Event: Minutes the event lasts once it begins.
//   Closing: Minutes after the event ends before the place is cleaned and everyone is sent out.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  WarningTime    NotifyTime    EventTime    CloseTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
0
    5              1             15           4
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// Level Groups
// The range that can enter each one: one for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner and another for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter. The value compared is the level, the resets or the master resets, as the BloodCastleStyle setting of the Event settings says.
//   Level: 0 to 6 are Blood Castle 1 to 7. 7 is the Master Level castle: it turns on when the file has a row 7 with a lowest value of 0.
//   Normal min: The lowest value that enters this one, for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner. It is compared with the character's level, resets or master resets, as the BloodCastleStyle setting of the Event settings says (0 level, 1 resets, 2 master resets).
//   Normal max: The highest value that enters this one, for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner.
//   Special min: The lowest value that enters this one, for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter.
//   Special max: The highest value that enters this one, for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~7]    [0~1000]    [0~1000]    [0~1000]     [0~1000]
//  Level    MinLevel    MaxLevel    MinLevel2    MaxLevel2
//----------------------------------------------------------
1
    0        0           4           0            4
    1        5           14          5            14
    2        15          29          15           29
    3        30          49          30           49
    4        50          69          50           69
    5        70          89          70           89
    6        90          1000        90           1000
//  7		0      0        0      0         //BC-Master-8
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// Statue
// Where the Statue of the Saint stands.
//   X: Column where the Statue of the Saint stands.
//   Y: Row where the Statue of the Saint stands.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]
//  X          Y
//----------------------------------------------------------
2
    14         95
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// Entrance Zone
// The free area where players enter.
//   From X: Left edge of the entrance zone.
//   From Y: Top edge of the entrance zone.
//   To X: Right edge of the entrance zone.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the entrance zone.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]
//  X          Y          X2         Y2
//----------------------------------------------------------
3
    13         15         15         23
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// Bridge Zone
// The free area of the bridge.
//   From X: Left edge of the bridge zone.
//   From Y: Top edge of the bridge zone.
//   To X: Right edge of the bridge zone.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the bridge zone.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]
//  X          Y          X2         Y2
//----------------------------------------------------------
4
    13         70         15         75
end

