//----------------------------------------------------------
// Experience
// The experience of the winner and of the other participants.
//   Level: The castle: 0 to 6 are Blood Castle 1 to 7 and 7 is the Master Level one.
//   Winner EXP: Experience of the winner and of the members of the winner's party.
//   Participant EXP: Experience of every other player who took part.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~7]    [0~9999999]    [0~9999999]
//  Level    WinnerExp      ParticipantExp
//----------------------------------------------------------
7
    0        20000          5000
    1        50000          10000
    2        80000          15000
    3        90000          20000
    4        100000         25000
    5        110000         30000
    6        120000         35000
    7        130000         40000
end

